WEBVTT

00:09:29.156 --> 00:09:31.756
What you are responsible for

00:09:31.756 --> 00:09:33.716
is the thing inside your control,

00:09:33.716 --> 00:09:37.996
indeed, the only thing
that has ever been inside your control.

00:09:38.476 --> 00:09:39.596
Your mindset.

00:09:41.116 --> 00:09:44.196
We all have stories running on repeat,

00:09:44.236 --> 00:09:45.916
stories that immobilize us,

00:09:45.956 --> 00:09:51.556
stories the world impresses upon us
in boardrooms and classrooms alike.

00:09:52.796 --> 00:09:55.316
"I'm just one in 7.8 billion people,

00:09:55.356 --> 00:09:57.876
I'm too small to make a difference."

00:09:57.876 --> 00:09:59.036
"I'm not smart enough."

00:09:59.076 --> 00:10:00.556
"I don't have the experience."